sic sweeps it and  carries you away when the visuals frame  the action in an exhilarating way as in  an early moment when red silhouetted  against the city speeds across cloud  bank on a motorcycle hunting the people  who are responsible for everything  that's happened  do me a favor  don't let me go so yes transistor is a  fun action role-playing game with a neat  combat system but beautiful moments like  this one make it more than that they  make it a game with a soul

